===== J2-65-R13-IntegralTernary.py =====
Q_rad(v)=P(v)+(K/G)S(v), with P,S the exact R7 binary-block forms.
For B_Lambda from SourceLattice, define Q_clear(w)=d^2*G*Q_rad(B_Lambda*w).
Q_clear has integer coefficients; let C_Q be their positive gcd and Q_prim=Q_clear/C_Q.
TERNARY_FORM_CONTENT=C_Q
TERNARY_FORM_SIGNATURE=(2,1)
Let Delta_fib=R(G,q)-4*K^2*G^2*(G+1)^2 and delta=gcd(G,2*d*(q+4)).
det(B_Lambda)=2*q^2*(q+4)*c/delta
det_Gram(Q_prim)=4*d^6*G^4*q^10*(G+1)^2*(q+4)^6*(2*G+q+2)*c^6*Delta_fib/(delta^2*C_Q^3)
DISCRIMINANT_CONVENTION=det(Hessian(Q_prim))=8*det_Gram(Q_prim)
